{"html":"\n\t\t\n<p><span>As we age, our skin undergoes various changes that can lead to wrinkles, sagging, and a loss of youthful vitality. At AestheticEye in Cincinnati, OH, our board-certified oculoplastic surgeons, Dr. Ginger Henson and Dr. Jonathan Pargament, offer a range of <a href=\"#/cosmetic-skin-treatments/\">advanced treatments</a> designed to address the signs of aging and restore a youthful, radiant appearance. Our personalized approach ensures that each patient receives the highest standard of care tailored to their unique needs.</span></p>\n\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h2 id=\"section-1\">Understanding the Aging Process</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><span>Aging is a natural process that affects everyone, but the visible signs of aging can be minimized with the right treatments. Several factors contribute to the aging of the face, including:</span></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n    <div>\n        <blockquote>\n            <div>Dr. Ginger Henson was a perfect choice for me! She did an excellent job. I had no pain and healed up better than ever! I’m so happy with the job she did for me!</div>\n                            <footer>Lynne S.</footer>\n                        \n        </blockquote>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h3>Causes of Facial Aging</h3>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_e053173b9b77028e3fa49d9ae3aeff4b\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_e053173b9b77028e3fa49d9ae3aeff4b-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Loss of Skin Elasticity</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Over time, the skin loses its elasticity and firmness due to a decrease in collagen and elastin production.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_e053173b9b77028e3fa49d9ae3aeff4b-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Volume Loss</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>The fat pads that provide volume and support to the face diminish, leading to a hollow or sunken appearance.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_e053173b9b77028e3fa49d9ae3aeff4b-column-2\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Muscle Weakness</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>The muscles supporting the face weaken, causing the skin to sag and form wrinkles.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_e053173b9b77028e3fa49d9ae3aeff4b-column-3\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Environmental Factors</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Sun exposure, smoking, and pollution can accelerate the aging process by damaging the skin.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_e053173b9b77028e3fa49d9ae3aeff4b-column-4\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Genetics</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Your genetic makeup influences how and when the signs of aging appear on your face.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div></div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h3>Anti-Aging Procedures at AestheticEye</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><span>At AestheticEye, we offer a variety of anti-aging procedures to rejuvenate your appearance and help you look as young as you feel. Our treatments are designed to address different aspects of facial aging, providing natural-looking results with minimal downtime.</span></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div>\n\n  \n\n  <a href=\"https://l.klara.com/G3yV4TBdY4dUMwAk\"> Book An Appointment</a>\n  <a aria-label=\"call us (937) 907-9009\" href=\"tel:9379079009\"> (937) 907-9009</a>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div><div>\n<h3>Smooth and Refine with Botox and Neuromodulators</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><span>Botox and other neuromodulators work by relaxing the muscles that cause wrinkles, providing a smoother, more youthful appearance.</span></p>\n\n\n<div id=\"column-content-block_b18dc3795c77ea041ff6be7aa1f91f5a\" class=\"source-columns\">\n            <div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_b18dc3795c77ea041ff6be7aa1f91f5a-column-0\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Erase Fine Lines</h3>\n                                                <div>\n                            <p>Reduce the appearance of crow’s feet, forehead lines, and frown lines.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div>\n                    <div id=\"column-content-block_b18dc3795c77ea041ff6be7aa1f91f5a-column-1\" class=\"source-card\">\n                                                    <h3>Prevent New Wrinkles</h3>\n                                              